{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"NexusSnapshot","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentMacro","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/SavingAndLoadingScenes"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A snapshot references the live components and entity identifier generator of the nexus. Encode it right after creation."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The encoded form starts with the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusSnapshot\/formatVersion","isActive":true},{"text":" and lists all entities in ascending identifier order,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"each with its original identifier (the raw value, here with generation 0) and its components keyed by their stable ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/RegistrableComponent\/componentTypeName","isActive":true},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["{","  \"formatVersion\": 3,","  \"entityIdGenerator\": { \"nextFreshId\": 3, \"recycledIds\": [] },","  \"entities\": [","    { \"id\": 1, \"components\": { \"MyGame.Position\": { \"x\": 1, \"y\": 2 } } },","    { \"id\": 2, \"components\": {}, \"sharedComponents\": { \"MyGame.Position\": 1 } }","  ]","}"],"syntax":"json"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"entityIdGenerator","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is present if the generator of the nexus is a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Fir